  "solution": {
    "text": "Metals with lower SRP can displace the metal with higher SRP from their solutions. Mg with lower SRP (-2.34) can reduce both  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>  (-0.76) and  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>  (-0.44).",
